### Listar Marcas
@host = http://localhost:8080
GET {{host}}/api/marcas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Listar Categorías
GET {{host}}/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Crear Producto (Smartphone)
POST {{host}}/api/productos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sku": "SAMSUNG-S24-ULTRA",
  "nombre": "Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra",
  "marcaId": 1,
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "modelo": "S24 Ultra",
  "color": "Titanium Gray",
  "capacidad": "512GB",
  "precioCompra": 3500.00,
  "precioVenta": 4800.00,
  "stockInicial": 10,
  "stockMinimo": 2
}

### Listar Productos con Filtros
GET {{host}}/api/productos?marcaId=1&modelo=S24
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Obtener Producto por ID
GET {{host}}/api/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Actualizar Producto
PUT {{host}}/api/productos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sku": "SAMSUNG-S24-ULTRA-EDIT",
  "nombre": "Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Editado",
  "marcaId": 1,
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "modelo": "S24 Ultra",
  "color": "Negro",
  "capacidad": "512GB",
  "precioCompra": 3500.00,
  "precioVenta": 4900.00,
  "stockMinimo": 3
}

### Desactivar Producto (Baja Lógica)
DELETE {{host}}/api/productos/4
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
